  "content": {
    "title": "When does the new Hannah Montana special come out? Miley Cyrus marks 20th 'Hannahversary'",
    "text": "Updated March 23, 2026, 12:04 p.m. CTMiley Cyrus is releasing a special to celebrate the 20th anniversary of her Disney show, \"Hannah Montana.\"The \"Hannah Montana 20th Anniversary Special\" will stream on Disney+ starting March 24.It will feature an in-depth interview with Cyrus, archival footage, and recreated sets from the show.It's Miley Cyrus' \"Hannahversary.\"It's been 20 years since Cyrus, a Nashville native, debuted on the hit Disney TV show, \"Hannah Montana.\" The teen sitcom ran for four seasons from 2006 to 2011.To celebrate the show and the \"Hannah Montana\" rockstar character, Cyrus is releasing a Hannah Montana 20th Anniversary Special on March 24, the original TV show's air date. The special promises to be a nostalgic lookback at the music and major moments of the show.The special will be filmed in front of a live studio audience and features an exclusive, in-depth interview with Cyrus, hosted by Alex Cooper. There will be never-before-seen archival footage and recreated sets, too, according to Disney+.“It’s about to be the 20-year Hannahversary in March!” Cyrus said in July. “I want to design something really, really special for it because it really was the beginning of all of this that now sits here today.”Here's what to know and how to watch.New 'Hannah Montana' project inspired by Dolly PartonTennessee legend Dolly Parton, 80, has a decades-long friendship with Cyrus' parents, Billy Ray Cyrus and Tish Cyrus-Purcell. Parton guest-starred on three episodes of \"Hannah Montana\" during the series' run.\"I learned this terrible habit — but I actually think it was good advice — from Dolly,\" Cyrus said in an interview with Variety published March 18. \"She told me that if you want something to happen, promote it before it exists. Then no one can say no.\"Cyrus first hinted at the planned celebration in an interview posted by SiriusXM on July 22, 2025. Disney+ announced the special on Feb. 17. Then, she willed it into existence with the advice from the queen of country herself.\"I just started promoting a 'Hannah Montana' 20th anniversary special that literally did not exist,\" Cyrus told Variety, adding that she would send fan reactions to Disney executives. \"I'm telling you, this would be huge.\"What time does the 'Hannah Montana' 20th Anniversary Special come on?You can stream the \"Hannah Montana\" special beginning March 24. Disney+ typically releases shows around 3 a.m. ET, midnight PT.Subscribe to Disney+ and watch the Hannah Montana specialWhere can I watch the 'Hannah Montana' 20th Anniversary Special?Fans can watch Cyrus' interview and special on Disney+.Additionally, the streaming platform currently features all four seasons of \"Hannah Montana,\" \"Hannah Montana: The Movie\" and \"Hannah Montana and Miley Cyrus: The Best of Both Worlds Concert,\" according to Disney+. Miley Cyrus and her Disney personaCyrus rose to fame partially from her starring role on \"Hannah Montana,\" which aired on Disney Channel from 2006 until 2011, according to IMDb.The 100-episode series starred Cyrus alongside Emily Osment, Mitchel Musso and father Billy Ray Cyrus. Two \"Hannah Montana\" movies were also created and released by Disney.The success of the teenage sitcom helped launch Cyrus' music career as well. Miley Cyrus released her debut album in 2007 titled \"Meet Miley Cyrus.\"\"Without Hannah, there wouldn't really be this me,\" Cyrus said in the interview.In 2024, Cyrus made Disney history when she was inducted into the Disney Legends hall of fame, becoming the youngest person to receive the honor.Where is Miley Cyrus from?The two-time Grammy-winning artist was born in Franklin, Tennessee, on Nov. 23, 1992. Franklin is a suburb of Nashville, located about 20 miles south of downtown.Is Hannah Montana going on tour?Despite early rumors of the 20th anniversary plans, no concert or tour is planned.When did Hannah Montana stop touring?The last time that Miley Cyrus took the stage as Hannah Montana was back in 2008 with the \"Best of Both Worlds Tour,\" according to Songkick.What was the last album of Hannah Montana?The \"Hannah Montana\" character had five studio albums, according to Genius. The last album was released in 2010 and called \"Hannah Montana Forever.\"What is Miley Cyrus' net worth in 2026?Cyrus has an estimated worth of $160 million, according to Celebrity Net Worth. She has made her fortune with a successful acting and singing career that dates back to Cyrus' \"Hannah Montana\" days.Cyrus is the daughter of already successful country singer Billy Ray Cyrus.Allison Kiehl covers trending and breaking news from Knoxville for the Tennessee Connect Team. Email: allison.kiehl@knoxnews.comSupport strong local journalism and unlock premium perks at knoxnews.com/subscribe.",
